<h1>Visiting the workshop</h1>

<h2 class="h5">Where we are</h2>
<p>123 Main Street, in the neighborhood, next to the hardware store.</p>

<h2 class="h5">When we're open</h2>
<p>Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm. Saturdays, 10am to 2pm.</p>

<h2 class="h5">Bringing a bike in</h2>
<p>
  Walk in with your bike, tell us your name and phone number, and we'll tag it and take a
  couple of photos before it goes on the rack. If it's a quick fix, it can go out the same
  afternoon. If it needs real work, one of our mechanics will call you with a quote before
  touching it.
</p>